<title>USA: Fairchild Corp completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Fairchild Corp completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Fairchild Corp said Thursday its Fairchild Fasteners division completed the acquisition of common shares and convertible notes representing, on a fully diluted basis, 84.2 percent of Simmonds S.A. from Mines de Kali Sainte-Therese S.A.</p>
<p>Fairchild also announced its intent to tender immediately for the remaining shares and convertible debt of Simmonds S.A. held by the public. Assuming the successful conclusion of the tender, the total cash payment will be about $25 million, along with the assumption of about $33 million in debt.</p>
</text>
